1
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,720
Seriously? Your dirty clothes are still there.

2
00:00:51,420 --> 00:00:54,920
Oh, come on. I'll pick them up in a sec.

3
00:00:55,620 --> 00:00:59,120
It's been three days. We need to split chores better.

4
00:00:59,820 --> 00:01:03,580
I know, I know. My turn to clean the bathroom, right?

5
00:01:04,280 --> 00:01:07,260
And don't forget taking out the trash today.

6
00:01:07,960 --> 00:01:10,680
Got it. Consider it done by tonight.

7
00:04:15,000 --> 00:04:17,980
What was that smell coming from the kitchen?

8
00:04:18,680 --> 00:04:21,660
My attempt at baking lasagna, apparently. It burned.

9
00:04:22,360 --> 00:04:25,600
Oh no! I was really looking forward to it.

10
00:04:26,300 --> 00:04:29,020
Yeah, well, it's definitely not edible now.

11
00:04:29,720 --> 00:04:32,700
So, what are we having for dinner then?

12
00:04:33,400 --> 00:04:36,120
Looks like my cooking skills are rusty.

13
00:08:04,000 --> 00:08:06,980
Do we have anything else in the fridge?

14
00:08:07,680 --> 00:08:10,400
Just some old leftovers. Not very appealing.

15
00:08:11,100 --> 00:08:14,080
Ugh, I'm starving. I really need real food.

16
00:08:14,780 --> 00:08:18,020
Me too. Maybe we should just order in tonight.

17
00:08:18,720 --> 00:08:21,700
That's a brilliant idea! What are you craving?

18
00:08:22,400 --> 00:08:25,120
Pizza sounds amazing after that culinary disaster.

19
00:12:16,000 --> 00:12:18,980
Okay, I'll call for a large pepperoni pizza.

20
00:12:19,680 --> 00:12:22,140
Awesome! We'll split the cost, right?

21
00:12:22,840 --> 00:12:25,820
Of course. My treat for the burnt lasagna.

22
00:12:26,520 --> 00:12:28,980
Nah, let's go halfsies. It's fine.

23
00:12:29,680 --> 00:12:32,660
You're the best. I'm so hungry right now.

24
00:12:33,360 --> 00:12:36,340
It'll be here soon. Let's watch a movie.

